			"notes": "## v1.2.2\n\n### New Features\n- Added **Upside Down Reinforced Target** — multi-hit target with flipped hitboxes and upside-down rendering\n- Added **Upside Down Indestructible Target** — indestructible version with upside-down hitboxes\n- Added **Upside Down Target** (normal) — single-hit target with upside-down orientation\n- Added **Hanging Targets** (normal, hardened, indestructible)\n\n### Changes\n- Swapped UPPER/LOWER hitbox shapes on upside-down targets so projectiles register hits on the correct face\n- Added 180° model rotation for proper upside-down rendering\n- All upside-down targets display the placing player's skin on the head\n- Upside-down targets support custom naming via anvil and emit redstone on knockdown"
		},
